# Uleguerand - Dominion Op #01 (abyssea 101, op 574): a level 99 Warrior in Abyssea - Uleguerand; the op's target
# Mechanical_Menace (19 placed spawns, the first 17813813). The next op (#02, Spectator) and Altepa's and Grauberg's #01
# accepted (a GM), this op available: a Mechanical_Menace killed: no section: nothing. This op accepted (a GM;
# activeDominionOp stays 0, which dominionOnMobDeath does not read): a Mechanical_Menace killed:
# dominionOnMobDeath(574): Quest[8][101]Prog 1 (FOV_DEFEATED_TARGET 1 of 5). The next op's Spectator killed:
# Quest[8][102]Prog 1 (its own count), this op's unchanged. Prog 4 (a GM): one more: Prog 5 (5 of 5); another: the count
# is full (numDefeated < 5 is false): nothing. Completed (Prog 0, as completeDominionOp leaves it; a GM): another
# killed: no section: nothing. Abyssea - Uleguerand's IDs.lua names no mob, so each kill names its mob by id
# (kill #<id>). Perfect Dodge, Invincible and Elemental Sforzo (GM effects) keep the chars alive through the kills (the
# Abyssea mobs aggro and link).
lists AbysseaUleguerand/Mechanical_Menace/onMobDeath AbysseaUleguerand/Spectator/onMobDeath
char zone=AbysseaUleguerand pos=-240,-40,-520 job=WAR lvl=99
login
effect 49                               # a GM: Perfect Dodge (melee hits evaded)
effect 50                               # a GM: Invincible (no physical damage)
effect 522                              # a GM: Elemental Sforzo (no magic damage)
quest Abyssea.DominionOp02Uleguerand accepted # a GM: the next op
quest Abyssea.DominionOp01Altepa accepted # a GM: Altepa's #01
quest Abyssea.DominionOp01Grauberg accepted # a GM: Grauberg's #01
kill #17813813                          # available: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp01Uleguerand accepted # a GM
kill #17813814                          # accepted: Prog 1
kill #17813789                          # Spectator: Quest[8][102]Prog 1
charvar Quest[8][101]Prog 4             # a GM
kill #17813815                          # Prog 5
kill #17813816                          # full: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp01Uleguerand completed # a GM
charvar Quest[8][101]Prog 0             # a GM
kill #17813817                          # completed: nothing
